diff --git a/docs/architecture.md b/docs/architecture.md
index a6b3fa6..3c932b0 100644
--- a/docs/architecture.md
+++ b/docs/architecture.md
@@ -67,3 +67,16 @@
     - `"Draw"` guarantees every player with strictly more points than N-th place and draws remaining spots at random among all players tied at N-th place's points (ignoring speed).
     - Players with `0` points never win; if fewer than `N` players have points, all of them win.
     - `"Reset winners"` clears all winners.
+
+## Question Timer (Release 4)
+- **Quiz Settings (`quizzes.timer_minutes`, `quizzes.timer_seconds`)**:
+  - Both default to `0` (`>= 0`, integer), labeled `"Timer minutes"` and `"Timer seconds"`. `0` minutes and `0` seconds disables the timer.
+  - Snapshotted onto `games.question_timer_seconds` (`timer_minutes * 60 + timer_seconds`) when `Game.create_from_quiz!` creates a game, so editing quiz settings does not affect running or past games.
+  - Excluded from `Quiz#export_payload` (`QuizImport` leaves timer at `0:00`).
+- **Countdown & Persistence Across Reloads**:
+  - `Game#question_deadline` computes `current_question.opened_at + question_timer_seconds.seconds`; `Game#timer_remaining_ms` and `Game#timer_remaining_seconds` derive remaining time from the server timestamp so page reloads continue smoothly without restarting the countdown.
+  - Rendered on the moderator big screen (`app/views/moderate/games/_stage.html.erb`) in `M:SS` format via `ApplicationHelper#format_countdown` and ticked client-side by `app/javascript/controllers/question_timer_controller.js` using `performance.now()`. Never rendered in player templates.
+- **Auto-finish & Early Finish**:
+  - At `0:00`, `question_timer_controller.js` submits `POST /moderate/games/:id/finish_question` via Turbo Stream.
+  - `FinishExpiredQuestionJob` is also scheduled via `set(wait_until: deadline)` when `Game#start!` or `Game#next_question!` opens a timed question, and `Game#expire_question_if_needed!` / `Game#record_answer!` enforce deadlines server-side if a client reloads, polls `state`, or submits a late answer after expiry.
+  - Passing `expected_question_id` and locking the `Game` row ensures clicking `"Finish"` early or concurrent expiration triggers only a single clean transition and broadcast.
